    <div class="sec-body">
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>The regulations of this Chapter shall apply:</p>

<ol><li>to the provision of affordable housing, as set forth in <a class="sec-link-inline" target="_blank" href="/article-ii/chapter-7#27-10"><span>27-10</span></a> (ADMINISTRATION OF AFFORDABLE HOUSING); and</li>
	<li>to anti-harassment areas, as set forth in <a class="sec-link-inline" target="_blank" href="/article-ii/chapter-7#27-20"><span>27-20</span></a> (ANTI-HARASSMENT).</li>
</ol></div>
      
          </div>

</article>





